		<letterStack>
			<letters>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>Good</def>
					<label>Caravan request</label>
					<lookTarget>@WorldObject_71</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>A nearby settlement, Ntent, contacts you with a special trade request. They would like to purchase:

  Psychoid leaves x863

In return, they offer:

  Silver x2833

This request expires after: 21 days

If you want to make the trade, send a caravan with the requested supplies. You can review this offer by selecting Ntent on the world map.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Solar flare</label>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>A solar flare has begun.

The intense radiation will shut down all electrical devices.

It should pass in about a day.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>Good</def>
					<label>Item stash opportunity</label>
					<lookTarget>@WorldObject_108</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>Marjot, prime councilor of Southwestern Tiberium, has sent us a message.

They've learned that a collection of valuable items have been left for the taking not far from us. The collection consists of:

  Scout jacket(brown) (shoddy)
  Scout jacket (normal)
  Trooper jacket (normal)
  Jedi Robe (shoddy)
  Jedi Robe (normal)
  Jedi Hood (good)
  Power armor helmet (normal)

Unfortunately, it won’t last - others will take the items in 29 days if we don't.

Valuables tend to attract danger, so beware.

Unfortunately, Marjot has no idea who or what - if anything - might be guarding the stash.</text>
				</li>
			</letters>
		</letterStack>
